{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2022-03-18 07:55:00', 'title': "ETHISPHERE ANNOUNCES JOHNSON CONTROLS AS ONE OF THE WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES FOR THE 15TH TIME", 'text': "CORK, IRELAND, MARCH 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JOHNSON CONTROLS (NYSE:JCI), THE GLOBAL LEADER FOR SMART, HEALTHY AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS, HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED BY ETHISPHERE, A GLOBAL LEADER IN DEFINING AND ADVANCING THE STANDARDS OF ETHICAL BUSINESS PRACTICES, AS ONE OF THE\xa02022 WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES.\xa0 THIS IS THE 15TH TIME JOHNSON CONTROLS HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED FOR ITS ETHICAL BUSINESS PRACTICES AND THE QUALITY OF ITS GLOBAL COMPLIANCE PROGRAM."}